WEBVTT

00:16.110 --> 00:19.720
<b>Your eyes that look far
off into the distance</b>

00:19.720 --> 00:23.350
<b>They're listening to the
voice within your heart</b>

00:23.350 --> 00:27.340
<b>Embracing a still blue moon</b>

00:30.690 --> 00:34.260
<b>Your strength to keep on running</b>

00:34.260 --> 00:37.900
<b>Will open another new door for you</b>

00:37.900 --> 00:41.890
<b>Illuminate the night
that dawns too soon</b>

00:45.240 --> 00:52.480
<b>Even alone, I want to
keep on believing in you</b>

00:52.480 --> 00:59.760
<b>It's in such a moment that
this world will begin to stir</b>

00:59.760 --> 01:03.430
<b>What should we be searching for?</b>

01:03.430 --> 01:07.030
<b>Send out your soul</b>

01:07.030 --> 01:14.300
<b>We'll meet here again
someday, if that's the truth</b>

01:14.300 --> 01:17.940
<b>What should we fix our gaze upon?</b>

01:17.940 --> 01:24.680
<b>The reality that I reached
out and grabbed with my hand</b>

01:24.680 --> 01:28.450
<b>Let it go, Let's believe in it</b>

01:30.550 --> 01:35.290
<b>In a nebulous era when the
heavens and earth intermingled,</b>

01:35.290 --> 01:38.760
<b>the gods sent four envoys to the
West to rectify the disturbance.</b>

01:38.760 --> 01:40.500
<b>Genjo Sanzo...</b>

01:40.500 --> 01:42.000
<b>Son Goku...</b>

01:42.000 --> 01:43.530
<b>Sha Gojyo...</b>

01:43.530 --> 01:45.000
<b>Cho Hakkai...</b>

01:46.000 --> 01:49.270
<b>Heroic battles against
countless assassins.</b>

01:49.270 --> 01:53.610
<b>And even in the decisive battle
against their archenemy, Kougaiji,</b>

01:53.610 --> 01:56.040
<b>the Sanzo party managed
a victory somehow.</b>

01:57.610 --> 02:03.290
<b>But the greatest assassin was about
to come from the West for them.</b>

02:03.290 --> 02:04.990
<b>Her name...</b>

02:04.990 --> 02:07.780
<b>It's little Lirin!</b>

02:24.840 --> 02:25.910
<b>Hey, Sanzo...</b>

02:25.910 --> 02:27.140
<b>There's no food!</b>

02:27.140 --> 02:29.210
<b>What? How did you know?</b>

02:29.210 --> 02:31.280
<b>What else do you ever say?</b>

02:31.280 --> 02:32.950
<b>You've set yourself a pattern.</b>

02:32.950 --> 02:36.750
<b>Why don't you try saying
something else for once?</b>

02:36.750 --> 02:40.290
<b>What? You're always making
the same jabs too!</b>

02:40.290 --> 02:41.060
<b>Wanna fight?!</b>

02:41.060 --> 02:42.560
<b>Sure!</b>

02:42.560 --> 02:43.350
<b>I'll beat you up!</b>

02:43.960 --> 02:45.430
<b>I'll beat you up back!</b>

02:45.960 --> 02:47.550
<b>I'll beat you up back, back!</b>

02:48.160 --> 02:50.270
<b>I'll beat you up back, back, back!</b>

02:50.270 --> 02:52.700
<b>Don't they realize that's
another pattern?</b>

02:56.070 --> 02:57.540
<b>It's nothing unusual.</b>

03:05.880 --> 03:06.820
<b>What's this?</b>

03:06.820 --> 03:08.320
<b>Can't you tell by looking at it?</b>

03:08.320 --> 03:11.390
<b>It's a boulder. You know, a boulder?
It's tasty! Wanna eat it?</b>

03:11.390 --> 03:12.720
<b>Hey!</b>

03:12.720 --> 03:14.190
<b>Woohoo!</b>

03:14.890 --> 03:16.320
<b>That voice is...</b>

03:16.320 --> 03:18.150
<b>Master Sanzo's little friend.</b>

03:18.990 --> 03:22.060
<b>That's to say, the worst jinx ever.</b>

03:22.060 --> 03:23.530
<b>It's Lirin!</b>

03:25.570 --> 03:30.010
<b>Hey, baldy! I've come to
play with you again!</b>

03:30.010 --> 03:31.770
<b>Here I come!</b>

03:31.770 --> 03:34.340
<b>You don't have to come!
Hurry up and go home!</b>

03:34.340 --> 03:37.480
<b>Looks like we're in for
more trouble again.</b>

03:37.480 --> 03:42.220
<b>Hey, bald-Sanzo party, I'll
make you say uncle today,</b>

03:42.220 --> 03:43.680
<b>so you better be prepared!</b>

03:49.220 --> 03:51.160
<b>Hey, bald-Sanzo...</b>

03:51.160 --> 03:56.190
<b>What? Hey! Hey, don't
run, bald-Sanzo!</b>

04:04.470 --> 04:05.940
<b>You're so noisy!</b>

04:07.240 --> 04:09.470
<b>Shut up! You're just a dragon!</b>

04:12.410 --> 04:15.150
<b>I should've expected that from
the sneaky bald-Sanzo party.</b>

04:15.150 --> 04:18.120
<b>I guess ordinary methods
aren't going to work.</b>

04:18.120 --> 04:20.920
<b>If I try to defeat them in the
normal way, they'll just run.</b>

04:20.920 --> 04:22.390
<b>In a situation like this...</b>

04:25.030 --> 04:28.620
<b>Oh, I know! I just got a great idea!</b>

04:38.340 --> 04:39.810
<b>Here they come!</b>

04:44.710 --> 04:45.610
<b>That's...</b>

04:45.610 --> 04:47.080
<b>What?</b>

04:48.680 --> 04:50.990
<b>A brilliant plan, if I do
say so myself!</b>

04:50.990 --> 04:52.450
<b>I call it...</b>

04:56.060 --> 04:58.930
<b>Project Meat Buns on the Road!</b>

04:58.930 --> 05:01.830
<b>The baldies will notice the meat
buns and be overjoyed.</b>

05:01.830 --> 05:03.800
<b>Oh, meat buns! They look good!</b>

05:03.800 --> 05:05.270
<b>Little Lirin Kick!</b>

05:07.470 --> 05:09.700
<b>Yeah, it's perfect!</b>

05:13.070 --> 05:15.180
<b>Hey, come back!</b>

05:15.180 --> 05:18.170
<b>Baldy! Monkey! Water
Sprite! Cafeteria Lady!</b>

05:19.250 --> 05:23.080
<b>That's so weird! They're really
tasty-looking meat buns too.</b>

05:23.080 --> 05:25.710
<b>What?! The meat buns are gone!</b>

05:28.660 --> 05:30.230
<b>Did you see our
excellent handicraft?!</b>

05:30.230 --> 05:33.190
<b>Just goes to show what
we're capable of!</b>

05:33.190 --> 05:36.830
<b>But don't these meat buns
look delicious?!</b>

05:36.830 --> 05:40.140
<b>Hey, let's hurry up and eat them
before they get cold!</b>

05:40.140 --> 05:43.540
<b>You got it! They only taste half as
good once they get cold after all.</b>

05:43.540 --> 05:45.010
<b>Down we go!</b>

05:47.010 --> 05:48.710
<b>Well, then, gentlemen...</b>

05:48.710 --> 05:50.180
<b>Let's dig in!</b>

05:50.180 --> 05:51.680
<b>No!</b>

05:51.680 --> 05:53.370
<b>What did you say?</b>

05:54.120 --> 05:57.550
<b>Ooh, you make me mad!
Those are MY meat buns!</b>

05:57.550 --> 05:59.450
<b>Give them all back right this minute!</b>

05:59.450 --> 06:00.760
<b>Or else...</b>

06:00.760 --> 06:02.160
<b>Or else, what?!</b>

06:02.160 --> 06:03.460
<b>What is it?!</b>

06:03.460 --> 06:05.230
<b>Just what're you going to do to us?</b>

06:05.230 --> 06:08.360
<b>I think you'd better worry
about your own safety</b>

06:08.360 --> 06:10.070
<b>rather than about the meat buns.</b>

06:10.070 --> 06:13.000
<b>We won't go easy on you
just because you're a kid.</b>

06:28.880 --> 06:31.040
<b>I don't have to go easy
on you guys, right?</b>

06:32.590 --> 06:34.590
<b>Please go easy on us!</b>

06:34.590 --> 06:37.060
<b>Chief, we were the ones
who were wrong!</b>

06:37.060 --> 06:40.960
<b>We'll do anything, so
please forgive us!</b>

06:40.960 --> 06:42.490
<b>You'll do anything?</b>

06:43.730 --> 06:46.030
<b>Then that makes you
my henchmen, right?</b>

06:47.070 --> 06:49.170
<b>Henchmen?</b>

06:49.170 --> 06:51.540
<b>That's exactly right, Chief.</b>

06:51.540 --> 06:53.740
<b>Then I better give you guys names.</b>

06:53.740 --> 06:56.010
<b>Names? My name is...</b>

06:56.010 --> 06:56.640
<b>Porky!</b>

06:56.640 --> 06:57.310
<b>Po?!
Porky!</b>

06:57.310 --> 06:58.280
<b>You're Spot!</b>

06:58.280 --> 06:58.810
<b>Spo?!</b>

06:58.810 --> 06:59.750
<b>And you're Fluffy!</b>

06:59.750 --> 07:00.780
<b>Flu?!
And you're Fluffy!</b>

07:00.780 --> 07:02.680
<b>Why am I Spot?!</b>

07:02.680 --> 07:04.250
<b>We sound like pets!</b>

07:04.250 --> 07:06.450
<b>That's right! You have to be kidding.</b>

07:06.450 --> 07:07.720
<b>You have a problem?!</b>

07:07.720 --> 07:09.180
<b>No, Ma'am!</b>

07:10.020 --> 07:12.390
<b>Then let's get off to an energetic start!</b>

07:16.400 --> 07:20.860
<b>Wow, this is pretty high up! You can
even see a village from here.</b>

07:21.500 --> 07:23.770
<b>Is this really going to work, Spot?</b>

07:23.770 --> 07:24.670
<b>Uh-oh!</b>

07:24.670 --> 07:27.780
<b>Just leave it up to us, Miss Lirin!</b>

07:27.780 --> 07:30.250
<b>We might not be as good as you are...</b>

07:30.250 --> 07:31.510
<b>But we're strong!</b>

07:31.510 --> 07:34.480
<b>That's right. Getting a group
of four people to stop</b>

07:34.480 --> 07:36.070
<b>will be a piece of cake!</b>

07:36.820 --> 07:38.690
<b>Looks like they're here!</b>

07:38.690 --> 07:39.890
<b>I'll beat you up!</b>

07:39.890 --> 07:41.490
<b>I'll beat you up back!</b>

07:41.490 --> 07:42.820
<b>I'll beat you up!</b>

07:42.820 --> 07:43.290
<b>I'll beat you up back!</b>

07:43.290 --> 07:45.960
<b>I'll beat you up!
Just how long are you guys
going to keep that up for?</b>

07:45.960 --> 07:46.390
<b>I'll beat you up back!
Just how long are you guys
going to keep that up for?</b>

07:46.390 --> 07:47.500
<b>I'll beat you up back!</b>

07:47.500 --> 07:48.900
<b>I'll beat you up!</b>

07:48.900 --> 07:50.030
<b>I'll beat you...</b>

07:50.030 --> 07:51.800
<b>You good-for-nothings! Let's go!</b>

07:52.830 --> 07:55.270
<b>Oh, you're so naughty!</b>

07:55.270 --> 07:56.740
<b>This is stupid.</b>

08:01.040 --> 08:02.600
<b>Woohoo, not bad!</b>

08:05.480 --> 08:07.180
<b>Give us a ride!</b>

08:08.550 --> 08:10.350
<b>Please, give us a...</b>

08:16.520 --> 08:18.790
<b>Hello? You alive?</b>

08:19.760 --> 08:21.500
<b>I think I might be dead.</b>

08:29.200 --> 08:32.110
<b>I'm starving! You got anything to eat?</b>

08:32.110 --> 08:34.400
<b>Sir, you're eating too much!</b>

08:35.580 --> 08:37.510
<b>They're eating.</b>

08:37.510 --> 08:39.950
<b>You won't get to sit back and
relax for much longer.</b>

08:39.950 --> 08:43.120
<b>While you guys are in there
with your guards down...</b>

08:43.120 --> 08:45.480
<b>We'll put scratch marks on their car!</b>

08:45.920 --> 08:55.630
<b>And with that, their car will
be all scratched up!</b>

08:55.630 --> 08:57.300
<b>No!</b>

08:57.300 --> 08:58.960
<b>Did someone call?</b>

08:59.900 --> 09:01.570
<b>What's wrong, Hakkai?</b>

09:01.570 --> 09:04.410
<b>If you don't hurry up and eat,
Gojyo's gonna eat it all.</b>

09:04.410 --> 09:05.910
<b>What'd you say?!</b>

09:05.910 --> 09:07.840
<b>You wanna get beaten up again?!</b>

09:07.840 --> 09:08.810
<b>Wanna fight?!</b>

09:08.810 --> 09:10.280
<b>That's enough!</b>

09:11.650 --> 09:13.050
<b>That was a close one.</b>

09:13.050 --> 09:16.340
<b>Let's hurry up and wreck their
car before they find us.</b>

09:40.880 --> 09:43.240
<b>What?! What?! What?!
What?! What?! What?!</b>

09:43.240 --> 09:45.410
<b>Did you just say something?</b>

09:45.410 --> 09:46.910
<b>No, I didn't say anything.</b>

09:46.910 --> 09:49.050
<b>Which means...</b>

09:49.050 --> 09:51.590
<b>Instead of an engine inside,</b>

09:51.590 --> 09:54.060
<b>there must be people in there!</b>

09:54.060 --> 09:55.690
<b>Quit kidding around, you moron!</b>

09:55.690 --> 09:57.290
<b>That wasn't funny!</b>

09:57.290 --> 09:59.560
<b>I was being serious.</b>

10:03.200 --> 10:04.830
<b>What the heck was that?</b>

10:04.830 --> 10:06.330
<b>No idea.</b>

10:06.330 --> 10:08.930
<b>Strange things sure do
happen sometimes.</b>

10:10.170 --> 10:14.110
<b>Are you the bad people who
were picking on Hakuryu?</b>

10:15.510 --> 10:18.210
<b>So what if we are, you clown?</b>

10:18.210 --> 10:21.280
<b>How dare you run us over earlier?!</b>

10:21.280 --> 10:24.550
<b>We'll make sure to get our
compensation out of you!</b>

10:32.760 --> 10:34.590
<b>Miss!</b>

10:36.030 --> 10:40.300
<b>It's no good, Miss. Those
guys are pretty strong.</b>

10:40.300 --> 10:42.840
<b>There's no way we can
fight them head-to-head.</b>

10:42.840 --> 10:47.480
<b>Don't they have a weakness
of some sort?</b>

10:47.480 --> 10:48.940
<b>Weakness?</b>

10:50.380 --> 10:54.250
<b>But today certainly has
been an eventful day.</b>

10:54.250 --> 10:57.720
<b>Eventful? You mean a
pain in the butt, right?</b>

10:57.720 --> 10:59.650
<b>Man, I'm hungry.</b>

10:59.650 --> 11:01.420
<b>You still want to eat?!</b>

11:01.420 --> 11:02.920
<b>Demons!</b>

11:02.920 --> 11:04.760
<b>Oh, run!</b>

11:04.760 --> 11:07.460
<b>Deary me, demons are coming!</b>

11:07.460 --> 11:08.530
<b>Ferocious demons are going on a
rampage at the outskirts of town!</b>

11:08.530 --> 11:11.730
<b>Demons! Demons are coming!
Ferocious demons are going on a
rampage at the outskirts of town!</b>

11:11.730 --> 11:14.100
<b>Oh, how terrifying!</b>

11:14.640 --> 11:16.970
<b>The village will be
destroyed at this rate!</b>

11:16.970 --> 11:20.810
<b>Isn't there anyone who can
save us from this calamity?!</b>

11:20.810 --> 11:23.040
<b>I know! Surely, you men can...</b>

11:25.650 --> 11:27.620
<b>What do you take us for?</b>

11:27.620 --> 11:29.310
<b>Your disguises suck, you idiots!</b>

11:30.020 --> 11:31.610
<b>Looks like you need to be punished.</b>

11:32.390 --> 11:34.320
<b>Poor guys, again?</b>

11:35.620 --> 11:37.960
<b>Why?! According to our data,</b>

11:37.960 --> 11:40.260
<b>you're supposed to be susceptible
to feminine charms!</b>

11:41.200 --> 11:43.030
<b>Take a look in the mirror before
you come back again!</b>

11:44.100 --> 11:45.430
<b>Dumplings!</b>

11:45.430 --> 11:47.400
<b>Miss!
Dumplings!</b>

11:49.500 --> 11:51.030
<b>What the?! What the?!
What the?! What the?!</b>

11:53.940 --> 11:55.580
<b>Hey, you're back!</b>

11:55.580 --> 11:58.370
<b>Tell me how it went.
Spot? Fluffy? Porky?</b>

11:59.150 --> 12:04.020
<b>There's nothing TO tell! My
performance was perfect though!</b>

12:04.020 --> 12:06.220
<b>Is THAT what you call perfect?!</b>

12:06.220 --> 12:09.720
<b>We all know you blew our cover
with your sucky disguise!</b>

12:09.720 --> 12:13.960
<b>What're you talking about?! Your
disguises are the ones that sucked!</b>

12:13.960 --> 12:17.270
<b>No, I believe YOU two were
the problem!</b>

12:17.270 --> 12:19.930
<b>Oh, no, YOU two were the problem!</b>

12:19.930 --> 12:25.410
<b>Why can't you just lure them
out?! Sheesh!</b>

12:25.410 --> 12:26.770
<b>Pardon me, Miss?</b>

12:26.770 --> 12:27.780
<b>What is it?</b>

12:27.780 --> 12:30.650
<b>Maybe we keep failing because we
only try to lure them out?</b>

12:30.650 --> 12:33.750
<b>Perhaps we should head out there
and lay an ambush instead?</b>

12:33.750 --> 12:37.340
<b>I already tried that! But they
run away the minute they see it!</b>

12:38.450 --> 12:40.620
<b>Aren't you forgetting something?</b>

12:40.620 --> 12:43.960
<b>Miss, you've got us now.</b>

12:43.960 --> 12:46.030
<b>As long as you have us...</b>

12:46.030 --> 12:48.260
<b>We can attack them from both sides!</b>

12:48.260 --> 12:49.400
<b>Attack from both sides?</b>

12:49.400 --> 12:50.530
<b>Right!</b>

12:50.530 --> 12:54.500
<b>Attack from both sides!</b>

12:54.500 --> 12:58.040
<b>I see! I didn't think about that!</b>

12:58.040 --> 13:00.680
<b>Lirin's in shock!</b>

13:00.680 --> 13:01.380
<b>Now...</b>

13:01.380 --> 13:02.510
<b>Miss...</b>

13:02.510 --> 13:03.880
<b>...let's go!</b>

13:03.880 --> 13:07.850
<b>Spot! Fluffy! Porky!</b>

13:07.850 --> 13:09.120
<b>Miss!</b>

13:09.120 --> 13:10.580
<b>Thank you!</b>

13:12.650 --> 13:15.220
<b>We just wanna finish
this quick and go home.</b>

13:15.220 --> 13:17.460
<b>Why aren't we just
staying the night there?</b>

13:17.460 --> 13:20.790
<b>I've had it up to here with
that brat following us around.</b>

13:24.170 --> 13:25.900
<b>Man, again?</b>

13:25.900 --> 13:29.200
<b>It looks like we won't be
able to go on ahead with that.</b>

13:29.200 --> 13:30.670
<b>Shall we go back the way we came?</b>

13:33.010 --> 13:35.000
<b>Our retreat has been cut off too.</b>

13:36.180 --> 13:38.310
<b>Hey, Goku, this might be bad.</b>

13:38.310 --> 13:39.210
<b>What do you mean?</b>

13:39.210 --> 13:42.580
<b>That little girl might actually
be smarter than you.</b>

13:42.580 --> 13:44.050
<b>Don't group me in with her!</b>

13:51.660 --> 13:53.630
<b>Them again?</b>

13:53.630 --> 13:56.620
<b>I should think it'd be better if
they gave up on this already.</b>

13:57.500 --> 14:00.000
<b>How dare you beat us up earlier?!</b>

14:00.000 --> 14:02.500
<b>It hurt a lot!</b>

14:02.500 --> 14:04.900
<b>Where are you looking?!
We're over here!</b>

14:06.410 --> 14:08.880
<b>Ta-da!</b>

14:08.880 --> 14:11.280
<b>Lirin's first henchman, Spot!</b>

14:11.280 --> 14:14.020
<b>Lirin's second henchman, Fluffy!</b>

14:14.020 --> 14:16.950
<b>Lirin's third henchman, Porky!</b>

14:16.950 --> 14:20.990
<b>We're here to take your lives!</b>

14:20.990 --> 14:22.520
<b>Who the heck are you guys?</b>

14:22.520 --> 14:24.290
<b>Weird names!</b>

14:24.290 --> 14:29.460
<b>Don't laugh! We didn't get
these names by choice!</b>

14:29.460 --> 14:31.300
<b>It's embarrassing for us too!</b>

14:31.300 --> 14:35.370
<b>But it's too much to expect
them not to laugh.</b>

14:35.370 --> 14:36.840
<b>That's true.</b>

14:42.710 --> 14:46.370
<b>I've finally caught you, baldy!
You're not getting away this time!</b>

14:47.180 --> 14:50.590
<b>So she's here after all.
What a persistent brat.</b>

14:50.590 --> 14:52.620
<b>Man, I envy you.</b>

14:52.620 --> 14:55.990
<b>I wanna be pursued until
I'm sick of it for once too.</b>

14:56.790 --> 14:58.850
<b>I'll kill you, no joke.</b>

14:59.560 --> 15:02.500
<b>Say your prayers, bald Sanzo!</b>

15:03.060 --> 15:03.830
<b>Sa...</b>

15:03.830 --> 15:04.470
<b>...n...
Sa...</b>

15:04.470 --> 15:05.900
<b>...zo?
...n...
Sa...</b>

15:09.670 --> 15:16.380
<b>That super evil demon killer Genjo
Sanzo and his friends?!</b>

15:16.380 --> 15:18.710
<b>This is no joking matter.</b>

15:18.710 --> 15:22.620
<b>We could have an infinite number of
lives, and it still wouldn't save us!</b>

15:22.620 --> 15:23.740
<b>We're getting out of here!</b>

15:25.050 --> 15:27.050
<b>Hey, you guys!</b>

15:27.050 --> 15:27.560
<b>Uh-oh!</b>

15:27.560 --> 15:29.290
<b>You run and you're dead meat!</b>

15:29.290 --> 15:30.780
<b>No fair!</b>

15:33.390 --> 15:36.860
<b>Wah! Mommy!</b>

15:36.860 --> 15:38.870
<b>Quit crying!</b>

15:38.870 --> 15:41.300
<b>I know! I just got a great idea!</b>

15:41.300 --> 15:42.800
<b>Listen up, you guys.</b>

15:42.800 --> 15:44.270
<b>What is it?</b>

15:46.410 --> 15:48.040
<b>I see! I didn't think of that!</b>

15:48.040 --> 15:51.380
<b>I wish we'd realized it sooner!</b>

15:51.380 --> 15:53.470
<b>In that case, let's hurry
up and get going!</b>

15:55.650 --> 15:58.240
<b>Master Sanzo, save us!</b>

16:01.520 --> 16:03.010
<b>Perfect.</b>

16:03.920 --> 16:07.260
<b>We aren't doing this
because we want to.</b>

16:07.260 --> 16:11.070
<b>It's only because that
brat was threatening us!</b>

16:11.070 --> 16:14.640
<b>So, please! Save us!</b>

16:14.640 --> 16:15.770
<b>I refuse.</b>

16:15.770 --> 16:17.970
<b>Go away!</b>

16:17.970 --> 16:19.740
<b>No way!</b>

16:21.480 --> 16:24.380
<b>Hey, Spot, Fluffy, Porky!</b>

16:24.380 --> 16:29.940
<b>How dare you betray me?!</b>

16:32.390 --> 16:35.120
<b>No, Miss! It's a mistake! A mistake!</b>

16:35.120 --> 16:38.430
<b>This was our strategy!</b>

16:38.430 --> 16:39.590
<b>Strategy?</b>

16:39.590 --> 16:43.100
<b>Oh, please, we were just trying to
get them to lower their guard</b>

16:43.100 --> 16:45.370
<b>by pretending to have switched sides.</b>

16:45.370 --> 16:48.360
<b>That's right! A strategy!
Just a strategy!</b>

16:49.540 --> 16:53.110
<b>If you think we're lying, look at
our clear and innocent eyes.</b>

16:53.110 --> 16:54.010
<b>Wide open!</b>

16:54.010 --> 16:55.470
<b>Stare...</b>

16:56.510 --> 16:58.000
<b>See, aren't they clear?</b>

17:01.620 --> 17:05.090
<b>Oh, so that's what it was about?!</b>

17:05.090 --> 17:06.250
<b>I get it now!</b>

17:06.250 --> 17:08.120
<b>I'm so glad she's stupid.</b>

17:08.120 --> 17:12.290
<b>You guys stand back! I'll take
care of them by myself!</b>

17:12.290 --> 17:13.830
<b>Here I go!</b>

17:13.830 --> 17:15.820
<b>Good luck!</b>

17:16.730 --> 17:19.330
<b>We're gonna run when we
get the chance, got it?</b>

17:19.330 --> 17:20.870
<b>Of course.</b>

17:20.870 --> 17:23.700
<b>Hey, bald-Sanzo!</b>

17:23.700 --> 17:25.810
<b>Goku, you go.</b>

17:25.810 --> 17:27.340
<b>All right!</b>

17:27.340 --> 17:28.940
<b>But why me?</b>

17:28.940 --> 17:31.450
<b>You're closest to her in size.</b>

17:31.450 --> 17:34.350
<b>Why?! Hakkai's the one
who's good with kids.</b>

17:34.350 --> 17:37.690
<b>No, no, Gojyo knows how
best to deal with women.</b>

17:37.690 --> 17:40.490
<b>Think about it. That's Sanzo's love...</b>

17:40.490 --> 17:42.220
<b>I dare you to complete the sentence.</b>

17:43.160 --> 17:45.830
<b>You're gonna get hurt if
you don't pay attention!</b>

17:45.830 --> 17:47.590
<b>Little Lirin Kick!</b>

17:49.200 --> 17:50.730
<b>Oh, fine!</b>

17:50.730 --> 17:52.530
<b>Little Lirin Punch!</b>

17:54.170 --> 17:55.640
<b>Got ya!</b>

17:56.370 --> 17:58.340
<b>Hey, she's amazing!</b>

17:58.340 --> 18:02.740
<b>She might even be able to
defeat Sanzo at that rate.</b>

18:02.740 --> 18:04.800
<b>If we were to defeat Sanzo...</b>

18:06.650 --> 18:08.550
<b>We'd become heroes!</b>

18:08.550 --> 18:12.220
<b>All right! In that case, let's help
out just enough not to get hurt!</b>

18:12.220 --> 18:14.020
<b>All right!</b>

18:14.020 --> 18:15.450
<b>Here we go!</b>

18:19.760 --> 18:21.280
<b>All right! This time...</b>

18:24.930 --> 18:29.140
<b>Sanzo party, did you see the
power of our Miss Lirin?!</b>

18:29.140 --> 18:34.070
<b>We could beat the snot out of
you with just our pinkies!</b>

18:34.070 --> 18:37.040
<b>Say your prayers, bald-Sanzo
and sidekicks!</b>

18:41.550 --> 18:43.650
<b>Oh, it's so late already!</b>

18:43.650 --> 18:46.350
<b>I better get home fast, or
Yaone's going to scold me!</b>

18:48.390 --> 18:50.550
<b>Little Lirin's going home!</b>

18:54.030 --> 18:55.660
<b>Up we go!</b>

18:55.660 --> 19:00.900
<b>Bye-bye, bald-Sanzo! See you
later, Spot, Fluffy, Porky!</b>

19:06.040 --> 19:09.780
<b>Who were you going to
beat the snot out of?</b>

19:09.780 --> 19:12.850
<b>I wonder who should be the ones
saying their prayers here?</b>

19:12.850 --> 19:15.750
<b>Oh, no, you got it all wrong, Chief!</b>

19:15.750 --> 19:18.790
<b>I tried to stop them,
but you see, he...</b>

19:18.790 --> 19:20.620
<b>What are you saying?!</b>

19:20.620 --> 19:25.060
<b>It's your fault to begin with
for coming up with this plan!</b>

19:25.060 --> 19:29.800
<b>Don't be silly! It's your fault for
trying to steal those meat buns!</b>

19:29.800 --> 19:31.260
<b>What did you say?!</b>

19:33.330 --> 19:35.200
<b>That's enough.</b>

19:39.510 --> 19:41.740
<b>It certainly has been an eventful day.</b>

19:41.740 --> 19:43.780
<b>Hey, where're we going
to stay for the night?</b>

19:43.780 --> 19:46.950
<b>Oh, I'm starving. Hey, Sanzo...</b>

19:46.950 --> 19:47.820
<b>No!</b>

19:47.820 --> 19:50.720
<b>What?! Why not?! It's just one meal!</b>

19:50.720 --> 19:53.690
<b>We don't have any more time to waste.</b>

19:53.690 --> 19:56.490
<b>Man, what the hell?!
You cheap bald monk!</b>

19:56.490 --> 19:58.660
<b>You eat too much, you stupid monkey!</b>

19:58.660 --> 20:00.150
<b>Shut up!</b>

20:01.560 --> 20:05.100
<b>But what the heck was up
with those guys anyway?</b>

20:05.100 --> 20:06.570
<b>Don't ask me.</b>

20:07.270 --> 20:10.910
<b>Say, what the heck was up with us?</b>

20:10.910 --> 20:14.910
<b>It ended up with us just
coming to get beat up.</b>

20:14.910 --> 20:17.910
<b>I didn't eat one single meat bun.</b>

20:17.910 --> 20:19.750
<b>Oh, me neither!</b>

20:19.750 --> 20:20.850
<b>Me neither!</b>

20:20.850 --> 20:23.750
<b>Damn it! When we see
that woman again,</b>

20:23.750 --> 20:27.520
<b>we're gonna make her
treat us to meat buns!</b>

20:27.520 --> 20:29.990
<b>That's right! That's right! Let's do that!</b>

20:35.830 --> 20:37.730
<b>I hate this life!</b>

20:39.800 --> 20:46.210
<b>That's right, even
sudden tragedies come</b>

20:46.210 --> 20:51.580
<b>Looking good-natured,
without cause for suspicion</b>

20:51.580 --> 20:57.080
<b>Don't complain, just shut up</b>

20:57.080 --> 21:00.490
<b>And look up</b>

21:00.490 --> 21:06.290
<b>I'll stay in character no matter
how ordinary the scene is</b>

21:06.290 --> 21:11.700
<b>Before any talk of dreams or hopes</b>

21:11.700 --> 21:17.040
<b>It's probably the same for everyone</b>

21:17.040 --> 21:20.970
<b>You must fight against yourself</b>

21:27.980 --> 21:31.620
<b>The sun sets and a new day comes</b>

21:31.620 --> 21:33.590
<b>Repeating is one change</b>

21:33.590 --> 21:37.690
<b>Don't avert eyes from differences</b>

21:37.690 --> 21:41.830
<b>Your nerve and soul to the limit</b>

21:41.830 --> 21:44.500
<b>Go forward now</b>

21:44.500 --> 21:49.570
<b>Standing next to the taunt pressure</b>

21:49.570 --> 21:54.980
<b>I'll laugh more boldly and
fearlessly than anyone</b>

21:54.980 --> 22:00.410
<b>It's probably the same for everyone</b>

22:00.410 --> 22:04.440
<b>You must fight against yourself</b>
